      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dit pärä kɛ kui̱ Dhor",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ruac Kuɔth Nhial ben kä ɣä wëë i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Täämɛ, gat ran kɛt dit pärä kɛ kui̱ Dhor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi jɛ la̱r Dhor in te thok waath in la jälkɛ köök nɛɛni tin cieŋ jɔk yiëër, ɛn ɣöö mɛmɛ larɛ Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Kä Tar-cic lätdɛ kök kɛ ji̱ rɛy kuakniku tin ŋuan. Kɛ ɣöö ti̱i̱kɛ ciɛk in bo̱r, kɛnɛ ladiit kɛ thapiɛy kɛnɛ ya̱a̱yni tëë luɛli kɛ kuak duka̱niku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä la̱tkɛ kök kɛ ji̱ ɛ Ya-wan kɛnɛ Tu-bal kɛ Mɛ-cɛk. Kɛn la luɛlkɛ naath kɛnɛ kuak tin ca la̱t kɛ ciɛk in bo̱r kɛ kööku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä Beth-to-gar-maa luɛlɛ kuaku kɛ jio̱o̱k tuɔ̱ruɔ̱k kɛnɛ jiöŋkööri kɛ muɔ̱li. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱ Dɛ-dan la̱tkɛ kök kɛ ji̱, kä wi̱i̱ jɔk yiëër ti ŋuan kɛ ji̱ ko̱kädu. Kä kökɛ ji̱ tuɔ̱ŋ guɔ̱ri kɛnɛ giɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lät ji̱ Ɛ-dɔm kɛ ji̱ kɛɛl, kɛ kui̱ kuakniku tin ŋuan. Kɛn luɛlkɛ ji̱ bieyni ti tekɛ biɛɛl ti gööl, kɛnɛ ti ca tak agɔaa, kɛ bi̱i̱ mi bum, kɛnɛ pääm ti di̱t kökdiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱ Juda kɛnɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl lätkɛ kɛɛl kɛ ji̱. Luelkɛ ji̱ gɛmɛ kɛnɛ liɛɛth tuar kɛ liɛɛth jiaath Ɔ-lip kɛ ji̱th ŋɔ̱nyä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱ Da-math-kɛth lätkɛn kök kɛ ji̱ kɛ kui̱ kuakniku tin ŋuan, kɛnɛ kui̱ ŋɔaaniku tin ŋuan ti gööl, kɔaŋ in nööŋkɛ kä Ɣɛl-bon kɛnɛ miem deet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱ Daan kɛnɛ ji̱ Ya-wan tin la ji̱ U-dhal cikɛ rɔ̱ mat lätkɛ kɛ ji̱ kɛɛl, kɛ kui̱ kuakniku tin ŋuan. Kä bikɛ ji̱ luël ladiit in ca rɔk kɛɛl, kɛnɛ wal tin ŋi̱er ŋi̱eer kɛ rɔny thokëër. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱ Dɛ-dan la̱tkɛ ji̱ kä bieyni dua̱li tin la papkɛ jio̱kni leyni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱ Ä-rab-ya kɛnɛ ruëëc Ke-dhar diaal kɛ kɛn kööku tin nhɔki ɛlɔ̱ŋ kɛ ɣöö la kökɛ ji̱ dɛy rɔɔmni kɛnɛ rueeth rɔɔmni kɛnɛ det. Ti̱ti̱ kɛ kɛn tin la kɛn kɛ a lät kök kɛ ji̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä la köök Cɛba kɛnɛ Rɛɛma kök a lät kɛ ji̱ kɛɛl. Kä la luëlkɛ ji̱ wal tin ŋi̱er ŋi̱eer tin leny ti diaal kɛ gɔɔy kɛ guiy diaal tin di̱t kökdiɛn kɛnɛ da̱a̱p. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱ A-ran kɛnɛ Ka-nee kɛ E-dɛn kɛnɛ köök Cɛba kɛ A-cur kɛ Kil-mad lätkɛn kök kɛɛl kɛ ji̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn la luëlkɛ ji̱ bieyni ti mɛ̈ɛ̈k, bieyni ti yiël kɛnɛ ti tekɛ biɛɛl, kɛ karpɛtni ti tekɛ biɛɛl ti ca moc kɛ yiëëni ti ca yop agɔaa. Kɛ kɛn tɔ̱tɔ̱, cukɛ lät kɛɛl kɛ ji̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä babuuri ji̱ Tar-cic, jälkɛ kɔakɛ nyinku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
